WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.088 --> 00:00:04.712
Every lecture, students make mistakes.

2
00:00:04.712 --> 00:00:06.065
Then they erase them.

3
00:00:06.065 --> 00:00:07.413
The confusion…

4
00:00:07.413 --> 00:00:08.681
the false start…

5
00:00:08.681 --> 00:00:10.688
the moment it almost clicked.

6
00:00:10.688 --> 00:00:11.501
Gone.

7
00:00:11.501 --> 00:00:14.110
Every notes app keeps only the final page.

8
00:00:14.110 --> 00:00:16.272
But the learning happened before that.

9
00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:19.496
What if your eraser… was
your best study guide?

10
00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:24.875
That's TraceIt. Notes that
remember how you learned.

11
00:00:24.875 --> 00:00:27.691
You write along with any
lecture, recorded or live.

12
00:00:27.691 --> 00:00:29.613
And nothing you erase is lost.

13
00:00:29.613 --> 00:00:33.332
It becomes ghost ink, stamped to
the exact second of the lecture.

14
00:00:33.332 --> 00:00:36.340
TraceIt reads your pauses,
slow-downs and do-overs…

15
00:00:36.340 --> 00:00:38.152
…against your own pace.

16
00:00:38.700 --> 00:00:40.885
Every struggle becomes a moment.

17
00:00:41.795 --> 00:00:44.682
Hit Finish, and your mistakes
become a guided review.

18
00:00:44.682 --> 00:00:45.792
What went wrong.

19
00:00:46.100 --> 00:00:48.694
What the professor said
at that exact second.

20
00:00:48.694 --> 00:00:51.287
And a quick self-test, in ten languages.

21
00:00:51.287 --> 00:00:53.496
Get it right… and it's an aha moment.

22
00:00:53.496 --> 00:00:56.598
Fuzzy spots follow you,
until you've truly got it.

23
00:00:56.598 --> 00:00:57.700
And for teachers…

24
00:00:57.700 --> 00:00:59.871
one class, one join code.

25
00:01:00.100 --> 00:01:03.078
See the exact minute
the whole room got lost.

26
00:01:03.078 --> 00:01:05.100
Anonymous. Never a name.

27
00:01:05.100 --> 00:01:07.921
And the three moments
most worth re-teaching.

28
00:01:08.400 --> 00:01:10.874
Students learn from their own mistakes.

29
00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:12.653
Teachers see where to help.

30
00:01:13.700 --> 00:01:17.016
TraceIt. Your eraser is
hiding the good stuff.

31
00:01:17.100 --> 00:01:18.231
Try the demo.
